     <section class="manufacturing-services">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Premium Cut and Sew Manufacturing Services</h2>

            <p class="section-text">
                The importance of cut and sew services in modern apparel manufacturing cannot be overstated. At Wuzwear
                Industry, we specialize in providing top-notch cut and sew manufacturing solutions, including
                <strong>pattern making, grading, prototyping, and sample production</strong>, all the way through to
                bulk manufacturing.
            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
                Our skilled tailors and technicians are equipped to handle medium to large production runs while
                maintaining outstanding precision and quality. With us, you can build your clothing line completely from
                scratch, backed by limitless customization options to ensure your brand stands out in today’s
                competitive fashion industry.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="cards-container">
        
        <div class="card">
