                    Wuzwear Industry is your dedicated partner, offering innovative and sustainable one-stop apparel solutions tailored to your brand.
                </p>
                <a href="#" class="card-btn">Get a Quote</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617137968427-85924c800a22?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="An Ethical Clothing Factory">
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
                <h2 class="card-title">An Ethical Clothing Factory</h2>
                <div class="green-divider"></div>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Sustainable Apparel Manufacturing Made Easy.<br>
                    We at Wuzwear Industry deliver ethical, organic, and sustainable one-stop shop solutions for everything apparel, from design to final production.
                </p>
                <a href="#" class="card-btn">Get a Quote</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595341888016-a392ef81b7de?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A Trusted Clothing Partner">
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
                <h2 class="card-title">A Trusted Clothing Partner</h2>
                <div class="green-divider"></div>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Fashion Manufacturing Made Simple.<br>
                    At Wuzwear Industry, we provide sustainable and reliable one-stop solutions for all your apparel production needs, making the process effortless and efficient.
                </p>
