    </section>
    <!-- timeline section -->
     <section class="timeline-section">
        <div class="timeline-container">
            
            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Our Values</h2>
                    <ul class="timeline-list">
                        <li>At Wuzwear Industry, the safety and well-being of our workers is our top priority. We ensure fair wages, exceeding local standards to support our team.</li>
                        <li>We are committed to providing job security, safe working conditions, and a healthy environment for all our employees.</li>
                        <li>Every product at Wuzwear Industry passes through strict multi-step quality checks before shipment to guarantee premium quality for our customers.</li>
                        <li>We protect the originality of your designs with complete copyright security.</li>
                        <li>We pride ourselves on fast and reliable delivery, shipping orders within three to four working days.</li>
                        <li>We arrange direct online meetings with our clients and manufacturers to ensure clear communication and customer satisfaction.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Minimal Order & Global Approach</h2>
                    <p class="timeline-text">As one of the leading custom clothing manufacturers serving countries like the USA, UK, Canada, and beyond, Wuzwear Industry offers one of the lowest minimum order quantities in the market — just 50 pieces per design. Over the years, we've partnered with thousands of apparel brands, providing them with custom clothing, printing, embroidery, private labeling, and packaging services. Many of our clients started their journey with us and have since grown into well-known apparel brands in their regions.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Our Manufacturing Capability</h2>
                    <ul class="timeline-list">
                        <li>Hoodies (plain or with zipper)</li>
                        <li>Jeans (cut & sew)</li>
                        <li>Sweatshirts</li>
                        <li>Special leggings</li>
                        <li>Leather jackets</li>
                        <li>Socks</li>
                        <li>And many more apparel products</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="timeline-text highlight-text">We promise 100% customization — from fabrics to patterns, designs, and finishing. Our skilled production team ensures that every piece is tailored to your requirements with unmatched precision and quality.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Simple and friendly workflow for creative people</h2>
                    <p class="timeline-text">At Wuzwear Industry, we make it easy for brands and clothing manufacturers to bring their ideas to life. Whether you're a start-up or an established brand, our production line delivers professional services using your sketches or detailed tech packs. Beyond production, we also create logo apparel for organizations worldwide. What sets us apart is our dedication to quality, creativity, and seamless collaboration with clients across the globe.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Laser cutting</h2>
                    <p class="timeline-text">Wuzwear Industry offers advanced custom laser cutting services to enhance apparel design. From leggings and shirts to hoodies and denim, our laser cutting technology ensures precision and customization. We provide laser-cut clothing in a variety of sizes and patterns to meet the unique needs of different brands and manufacturers.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Custom casual dyeing options</h2>
                    <p class="timeline-text">We provide innovative dyeing solutions such as dip-dye, acid wash, and tie-dye clothing. Our dyeing services allow brands to create unique casual wear that stands out in the fashion market.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Providing custom hangtags and labels</h2>
                    <p class="timeline-text">Wuzwear Industry helps brands personalize their products with custom hangtags, fabric labels, and woven labels. From iron-carved and heat-pasted labels to satin and cotton options, we produce labels tailored to your needs. With low minimum order quantities, we make it easy for both emerging and established brands to create a strong identity.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Redesigning your apparel</h2>
                    <p class="timeline-text">As one of the leading apparel manufacturers, Wuzwear Industry offers complete customization services, including screen printing, embroidery, and weaving. With over twelve printing options available, we also provide 3D embroidery for a unique look — starting from as low as 50 pieces. We are a one-stop solution for businesses looking to refresh or redesign their clothing line.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">We produce and knit custom fabrics</h2>
                    <p class="timeline-text">With a low minimum order quantity of 200 pieces, Wuzwear Industry gives brands the opportunity to create custom knitted fabrics. We also source fabrics according to specific requirements. Our facilities include custom beaded and sequin work, hand and machine embroidery, heat transfer, foil and digital screen printing, lace work and denim washing effects, Pantone-standard fabric dyeing, custom sewing, cutting, trimming, and sampling, as well as the development of labels, tags, and packaging solutions. We provide everything from fabric production to finishing touches, helping brands create standout collections from start to finish.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <h2 class="timeline-title">Wuzwear Steps for Those Who Want to Start an Apparel Brand</h2>
                    <p class="timeline-text">As a clothing manufacturer, Wuzwear has helped many new clothing brands in the United States and other countries. We see many brands producing quality products but remaining unpopular due to lack of marketing strategies. Starting an online clothing store might seem easy, but it requires hard work, determination, and smart planning. Below are some important strategies for launching your clothing brand:</p>
                    
                    <ol class="timeline-ordered-list">
                        <li><strong>Choosing your audience & theme</strong> – Decide on a clear theme and target audience, such as sportswear, nature-inspired, or streetwear. A unique theme helps set your brand apart.</li>
                        <li><strong>Creating brand identity</strong> – A professional logo is essential for recognition. Wuzwear offers design packages to help new businesses build strong brand identities.</li>
                        <li><strong>Budget planning</strong> – It's not about how much you invest, but how wisely you allocate it. Recommended ratio: 5% administration, 60% manufacturing/design, 35% marketing.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- last section -->
     <section class="comparison-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Why WuzwearIndustry is Better Than Other Manufacturers</h2>
        
        <div class="table-container">
            <table class="comparison-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th class="col-hash">#</th>
                        <th class="col-brand">WuzwearIndustry</th>
                        <th class="col-others">Other Manufacturers</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="feature-name">Laborers</td>
                        <td>Fair wage and treatment (3x more than local rates). Worker safety is the highest concern. Career and job security. Follows labor laws strictly.</td>
                        <td>Paid very little, sometimes treated inhumanely. Worker safety often compromised. Risk of child labor.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="feature-name">Environment</td>
                        <td>Ethical manufacturing laws enforced. Sweatshop-free production.</td>
                        <td>Little oversight, pollution possible. Often older, less efficient technology.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="feature-name">Product</td>
                        <td>Strong quality control. Each product checked at least 3 times before shipment.</td>
                        <td>Lower quality perception. Risk of garments linked to factory accidents.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="feature-name">Process</td>
                        <td>Skype/video meetings for clear communication. Same language reduces misunderstandings. Toll-free USA number & free Skype worldwide.</td>
                        <td>Language/cultural barriers. Some "manufacturers" outsource without telling you.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="feature-name">Intellectual Property</td>
                        <td>Strong copyright and IP protections. Legal recourse available.</td>
                        <td>Weak copyright protections. High risk of designs being stolen.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="feature-name">Minimums</td>
                        <td>Small order minimums: 30-50 pieces per design.</td>
                        <td>Very high minimums: often 1,000+ pieces.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="feature-name">Turnaround</td>
                        <td>Fast restock possible in 4 days (via DHL/FedEx).</td>
                        <td>Slow restock: shipping alone takes 3+ weeks.</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </section>
   

